{"timestamp":"00:00:05.356","source":"Server","level":"LOG","message":"[{\"id\":25,\"date\":\"2026-11-20T04:17:55\",\"date_gmt\":\"2026-11-20T04:17:55\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/?post_type=project&#038;p=25\"},\"modified\":\"2026-11-20T04:17:55\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-11-20T04:17:55\",\"slug\":\"imagery\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"project\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/project\\/imagery\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Imagery\"},\"template\":\"\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false},\"class_list\":[\"post-25\",\"project\",\"type-project\",\"status-publish\",\"hentry\"],\"acf\":{\"projects\":\"In our current world of AI generation, I think that videos, voice files, and images will be hard pressed for in the court system.  I know Apple designed some sort of timestamp in their camera lens to prove that it was actually taken, but how will that be upheld in the court?  And what will they have to reveal to prove that they can actually do that?  It is a very interesting time for sure.  \"},\"_links\":{\"self\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/projects\\/25\",\"targetHints\":{\"allow\":[\"GET\"]}}],\"collection\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/projects\"}],\"about\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/types\\/project\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=25\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}},{\"id\":24,\"date\":\"2026-11-20T04:14:52\",\"date_gmt\":\"2026-11-20T04:14:52\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/?post_type=project&#038;p=24\"},\"modified\":\"2026-11-20T04:14:52\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-11-20T04:14:52\",\"slug\":\"ai-lawyer\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"project\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/project\\/ai-lawyer\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"AI Lawyer\"},\"template\":\"\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false},\"class_list\":[\"post-24\",\"project\",\"type-project\",\"status-publish\",\"hentry\"],\"acf\":{\"projects\":\"Another project I thought would be interesting would be to make an AI chat for the legal system that was just dedicated to legal issues and had access to all court cases for all jurisdictions and could actually give legal advice (with a reminder to double check the information given).  I wonder how the court system would view that type of AI chat for the legal profession.  \"},\"_links\":{\"self\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/projects\\/24\",\"targetHints\":{\"allow\":[\"GET\"]}}],\"collection\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/projects\"}],\"about\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/types\\/project\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=24\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}},{\"id\":22,\"date\":\"2026-11-20T04:11:18\",\"date_gmt\":\"2026-11-20T04:11:18\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/?post_type=project&#038;p=22\"},\"modified\":\"2026-11-20T04:11:18\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-11-20T04:11:18\",\"slug\":\"power-grids\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"project\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/project\\/power-grids\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Power grids\"},\"template\":\"\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false},\"class_list\":[\"post-22\",\"project\",\"type-project\",\"status-publish\",\"hentry\"],\"acf\":{\"projects\":\"I recently thought about trying to map the United States in power grids by using publicly available information such as Google Maps and other satellite imagery using a custom coded AI project.  I think that would be cool to do.  \"},\"_links\":{\"self\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/projects\\/22\",\"targetHints\":{\"allow\":[\"GET\"]}}],\"collection\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/projects\"}],\"about\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/types\\/project\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/dev-cs-55-13-week-11.pantheonsite.io\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=22\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}]"}
